    "title": "Fold a Binary Tree",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the root of a binary tree, determine whether the tree can be folded. A binary tree is foldable if its left and right subtrees are structurally mirror images of each other, regardless of node values.",
